{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f966d77e69a5228000e387bf871949072e7b5eff63c60bb40952ba1685fc8274", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影が終わった。\n後は、帰り支度をするだけなんだけど……）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄结束了。\n接下来只要收拾好东西准备回去了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "695d3f072d9bc55861777e8903080f1f21c2a6edabf4937ffdaabdae9921a428", "ja": "わっほ～い！　{$P$}さんと、\n教室をふたり占めですねっ♪", "zh": "哇～呼！能跟{$P$}先生\n两个人独占教室呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0f15a8fd50b0999a89cb2ddfe30d1addd9ee6d36a93325c375545a1d75e7de38", "ja": "ふたり占め……というより、なんだか\n居残りで補習を受けているみたいな気分だな……。", "zh": "与其说是两个人独占教室……不如说，总觉得像是在留下来补课一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "7a353a4d38d67570c4eb15937a0ef68aae65706112a7185c7e460c81c55f6d2b", "ja": "そうですか？　でも{$P$}さんと\n一緒なら、居残りも大歓迎ですよ！", "zh": "这样吗？不过只要和{$P$}先生在一起，就算留下来补课我也非常欢迎哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "6219862d02a875bf1228164fe49f4ccecd5e0c4826fa5282df83907116a47905", "ja": "それに、放課後の教室って、特に用がなくても\n残っていたくなっちゃいませんか？", "zh": "而且，放学后的教室，就算没什么特别的事，也会让人忍不住想留下来，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1005_p", "source_sha256": "50848fc2c8b3e7acd7237a1f15c6bc744b963fb11255cbb398269ee89297d3e8", "ja": "放課後の教室か……\n美奈子は、放課後よく残ってたりするのか？", "zh": "放学后的教室啊……\n美奈子，你放学后经常会留下来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "0c9b420845e6b575961deb877c21871a4706ad01453551b51fbd967b8fc30d04", "ja": "はい！　友達とのおしゃべりが、なかなか止まら\nないんですよね～♪　好きなアイドルの話とか……", "zh": "是啊！和朋友聊天总是聊得停不下来呢～♪比如聊聊喜欢的偶像什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "93424679c32af337f107d510f3a9999c1a7ef2014590f8a333b110a4feec09ff", "ja": "あとは新しくできた、おいしいお店の話とか！\n話題のお店は、やっぱり気になっちゃいますからね！", "zh": "还有新开的美味餐厅之类的话题！\n热门店铺果然还是会让人在意呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1008_p", "source_sha256": "47ba1f286a007ae5db87d78542b281c138a9ff9cba54f4158b50d7d56d9f7ea0", "ja": "はは、そうなのか。\nそれで、遅くまで残ってて先生に怒られたり？", "zh": "哈哈，是这样啊。\n所以还因为待到很晚，被老师训过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "0043c172c58565b60fd0708f81f0fa0a42ce816c16a6838a7b488ad6e4a2774b", "ja": "そうなんですよ！　ついつい盛り上がっちゃって、\n気がついたら、もう夕方で……。", "zh": "就是这样！一不小心聊得太起劲了，\n回过神来，已经到傍晚了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "74046e6c17624539eaca160ad7ec7442631aeb5d9350685077a70f4c6365bb09", "ja": "先生に注意されて、「あっ、もうこんな時間！」って、\nみんなで慌てて帰るんです。えへへ。", "zh": "被老师提醒后，大家就会慌慌张张地说“啊，都已经这么晚了！”然后一起回家。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "e09e6a4e2b8ebef1b4f05526c2c0ecc742bc61a74a75b7e724ce415275722588", "ja": "普段は劇場のレッスンとかお店の手伝いで、急いで\n帰ることが多いので。予定がないと、つい……。", "zh": "平时因为剧场的排练啊、帮店里干活啊，经常要赶着回去。没有安排的话，就会不自觉地……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4e25731f08d09efa29772da6c344bfa5906cb9eb7f2d76e393704949ec9122f9", "ja": "美奈子は劇場だけじゃなく、家の手伝いもあるもんな。\n今日は、残っていて大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "美奈子不只是要待在剧场，还得帮家里的忙呢。\n今天留下来没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "a4cf03d325a7f1e413bacdbd8b731fa82272d02ac09abc738ef909ab4b73ed3f", "ja": "はい！　今日はお仕事なので、手伝いはなしです。\nだからもうちょっと、おしゃべりしてもいいですか？", "zh": "好的！今天有工作，所以不用帮忙。\n所以，我可以再聊一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1014_p", "source_sha256": "069a86c742f28957d4d8fff48be7593df7c529362d93bd3496a39c61f0b090a0", "ja": "ああ。\n美奈子が大丈夫なら、付き合うよ。", "zh": "啊。只要美奈子没问题，我就陪你聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "577fedeae98616312dbc56918cc01d8290c8103eb17cc568c94b8ba3c2bc1b8e", "ja": "わっほ～い！　ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "哇～咿！谢谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "ff5fb96b77048cc6e0d561a54ef8fd8be48b811069c1f4bdaf57f42696a578ca", "ja": "今日は{$P$}さんと、\nいっぱいおしゃべりできちゃいますね……えへへ。", "zh": "今天可以和{$P$}先生聊好多好多了呢……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0143_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "63c442a59f535425125c372169fa79dbd6a5e8ddee9863ea338495de8afa0b1b", "ja": "なので、今だけは{$P$}さんを\nひとり占めです！　……なんちゃって♪", "zh": "所以，只有现在这会儿，我可以独占{$P$}先生了！……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
